cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use DifferenTT in your work, please cite the paper that introduces the factorized approximate inverse
  preconditioner in the tensor train format (preferred-citation), and this software.
type: software
title: DifferenTT.jl
abstract: >-
  A Julia library for solving partial differential equations in the tensor train (TT) format, with finite-difference
  operators on TT and quantized TT grids, sweeping and Krylov linear solvers, the factorized approximate inverse (FAI)
  preconditioner in the TT format, time steppers and incompressible Navier–Stokes solvers.
